{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, how's it going? Just wanted to give you the heads up on what's been happening lately- I took a creative writing class recently, and it was super enlightening!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-83f75ac7efe376f59f7e3d72", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.797873+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "83f75ac7efe376f59f7e3d72", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "83f75ac7efe376f59f7e3d72", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria! Wanted to let you know that I'm running for office again. It's been a wild ride, but I'm more excited than ever! How have you been?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-db1f3af6c4758569573b2307", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.826415+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "db1f3af6c4758569573b2307", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "db1f3af6c4758569573b2307", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Congrats, John! What made you decide to run again? As for me, I've been volunteering at a homeless shelter and it's really rewarding."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-95db65affbbb1c73e3a840f6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.850192+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95db65affbbb1c73e3a840f6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95db65affbbb1c73e3a840f6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! After my last run, I saw the impact I could make in the community through politics. It's rewarding to work towards positive changes and a better future."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-948ba58676f8bed4ab28572a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.873438+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "948ba58676f8bed4ab28572a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "948ba58676f8bed4ab28572a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow John, your enthusiasm for making a better future is inspiring. Making a positive impact is so rewarding! While volunteering yesterday, I met this amazing woman, Jean, who had been through a lot, yet stayed optimistic and resilient. She showed me the importance of gratitude and connection."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-0c7d6ac9e95ed39611b9a155", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.898100+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c7d6ac9e95ed39611b9a155", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c7d6ac9e95ed39611b9a155", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! How did she end up in such a situation, and how did she remain positive throughout?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-c787ba4afbbe70bf152882b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.927228+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c787ba4afbbe70bf152882b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c787ba4afbbe70bf152882b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: She had a tough time, going through a divorce, losing her job, and ending up homeless. Yet, she still values the little things and believes in the good of kindness."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-cae8d9c32f460291be61bc2f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.949515+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cae8d9c32f460291be61bc2f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cae8d9c32f460291be61bc2f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It's really inspiring to see someone staying optimistic even when things get tough."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-d125ed54c2ac2ee7f023aba4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.968322+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d125ed54c2ac2ee7f023aba4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d125ed54c2ac2ee7f023aba4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, sure is. It's a reminder that, no matter what, we can still find joy and hope."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-9958b1ac424a1ff6b091554c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:16.984142+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9958b1ac424a1ff6b091554c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9958b1ac424a1ff6b091554c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Keep up the great work, Maria! It's important to stay positive and thankful, even when life's tough. A little kindness and optimism can go a long way. Sounds like your volunteer work has been very influential - amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-f66572db597db83c73b3382c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.002685+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f66572db597db83c73b3382c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f66572db597db83c73b3382c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! Your words mean a lot. It's incredible how much positivity and optimism can impact someone."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-67abd7af728ac80bd02da9a5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.027779+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "67abd7af728ac80bd02da9a5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "67abd7af728ac80bd02da9a5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yep. It's moments like these that remind me of how important it is to be kind and optimistic."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-0357b481e4737837b26e4985", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.048153+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0357b481e4737837b26e4985", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0357b481e4737837b26e4985", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sure thing, John. Those things can really make a difference. Let's keep spreading positivity and making an impact together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-98fdceba4e8de323aee07650", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.071297+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "98fdceba4e8de323aee07650", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "98fdceba4e8de323aee07650", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I totally agree, Maria! Let's keep helping each other and make the world a better place."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-b0bda7714a77b37cea138652", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.089088+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b0bda7714a77b37cea138652", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b0bda7714a77b37cea138652", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sounds cool, John! Let's make some positive change and brighten up that place. Do you have anything fun coming up soon?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-f0e9dec339b605f56ec45862", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.109058+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f0e9dec339b605f56ec45862", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f0e9dec339b605f56ec45862", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Let's do it, Maria! Together, we can make a real difference and bring a brighter future. And nothing too soon, but my colleague Rob invited me to a beginner's yoga class."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-59b86e3a3a7ce07062ac44e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.129489+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "59b86e3a3a7ce07062ac44e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "59b86e3a3a7ce07062ac44e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sounds fun! I hope you have a good time. In the meantime, let's work together to make things better for our community."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_7-ea820f052eb7b3beb47a52da", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:36:17.146856+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ea820f052eb7b3beb47a52da", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ea820f052eb7b3beb47a52da", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
